    "name": "How long does it take to get an insurance license in California?",
    "acceptedAnswer": {
     "@type": "Answer",
     "text": "Once they get the necessary paperwork, the Department normally needs 4 weeks to process and issue your insurance license. When your application is accepted, you will get an email with a link to the Department’s website where you can view and print your insurance license."
    }
